-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- acore_playerbots catch-up for the mod-playerbots update (module @ b949b50b, 2026-09-04).
--
-- The DB was last brought up to date on 2026-02-09 at 2026_01_31_00. This applies the 14 update
-- files released since, plus 2026_01_31_00 itself, which upstream edited after we ran it
-- (stored hash 33E26A1A..., current file 3564C507...).
--
-- acore_chars and acore_world need NOTHING: every module base file and update there is already
-- recorded in their `updates` tables and hashes match the new fork byte for byte.
--
-- Each section ends by writing the file's row into `acore_playerbots`.`updates`, exactly as the
-- built-in DBUpdater would, so the server does not re-apply it on the next start. The rows are
-- written per section, so stopping half way still leaves an accurate record.
--
-- Note: 2026_06_19_00 truncates playerbots_equip_cache / rnditem_cache / rarity_cache
-- (~208k rows today). That is intended -- the module rebuilds them, so expect a slower
-- first start after this runs.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SET NAMES utf8mb4;

USE `acore_playerbots`;

